{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE GAME\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/AG_Maingif.gif?t=1741713478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ethereal Odyssey</strong> is challenging 2D action-adventure platformer with non-linear exploration, rewarding curiosity and discovery, where secrets in every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lost boy awakens. The world around him shifts, twisting between the real and the imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world was once a dream is now a prison, shifting with every step. What waits beyond the veil?\u00a0A forgotten past, an unseen presence, or something far more dangerous?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TIMELESS ART STYLE\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/AG_Platforming_GIF.gif?t=1741713478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The unique emotional landscape of the <strong>Ethereal Odyssey</strong>, rich with symbolism, mysterious creatures, and hidden secrets. Every aspect of the presentation draws you into its dream world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MEMORABLE CHARACTERS\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/AG_Meet_TheDuck_GIF.gif?t=1741713478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every character you meet adds depth with hidden stories and abilities that help you progress through journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRANSFORMATIONS\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/AG_BearJumping_GIF.gif?t=1741713478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize the full power of the forms to unlock paths and new abilities that help you defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MECHANICS AND COMBAT\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your abilities to conquer enemies and adapt in grand boss battles with spectacular animations and dynamic areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE DREAM IS CALLING\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/extras/AG_Darkness_GIF.gif?t=1741713478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the Darkness spreads, the world unravels. The echoes are fading. Time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you break free\u2014or become another forgotten memory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist now and join our community to leave your mark in the credits and play an important role in shaping the video game. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3458930?t=1741713478","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/9ec495306533edadf3e45c46f31078e4d1367ffc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741713478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/62366c1759f1fc8d0ada6954e6ac283dc69247c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741713478","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458930/62366c1759f1fc8d0ada6954e6ac283dc69247c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741713478","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 